1
00:00:15,623 --> 00:00:17,352
"Because... I want to be more than just friends."

2
00:00:17,352 --> 00:00:20,145
"And the winning team is..."

3
00:00:20,145 --> 00:00:21,876
"Team B... Mr. Pong."

4
00:00:25,039 --> 00:00:28,310
"Last time... you just got lucky."

5
00:00:29,705 --> 00:00:33,143
"But truth be told... someone like you could never beat me."

6
00:00:33,143 --> 00:00:36,488
"I bet Pong sent someone to steal our prototype."

7
00:00:37,954 --> 00:00:39,372
"I've done everything Dad told me to..."

8
00:00:39,372 --> 00:00:40,904
"I gave the designs to Pong..."

9
00:00:42,203 --> 00:00:42,840
"Are you satisfied now, Dad?"

10
00:00:44,745 --> 00:00:46,665
"How are you... feeling any better?"

11
00:00:46,665 --> 00:00:50,770
"Otherwise, I really don't know how else to cheer you up."

12
00:00:51,952 --> 00:00:53,028
"Aargh!! Din!"

13
00:00:53,028 --> 00:00:54,673
"I'm really sorry."

14
00:01:18,032 --> 00:01:19,785
"Din..."

15
00:01:19,785 --> 00:01:20,577
"Oh... hey."

16
00:01:20,577 --> 00:01:21,546
"How are you holding up?"

17
00:01:21,546 --> 00:01:22,948
"Got ten stitches."

18
00:01:22,948 --> 00:01:24,457
"The doctor did a really great job, you know."

19
00:01:24,457 --> 00:01:26,387
"I'll go handle your medical bill."

20
00:01:26,387 --> 00:01:27,392
"What are you doing?"

21
00:01:27,392 --> 00:01:30,653
"Just sit down. I'll handle this."

22
00:01:30,653 --> 00:01:32,052
"Don't feel bad about it."

23
00:01:32,052 --> 00:01:33,464
"I want to make it up to you."

24
00:01:33,464 --> 00:01:34,817
"And how will you do that?"

25
00:01:34,817 --> 00:01:36,799
"Like this... I'll go pay for your bill."

26
00:01:37,780 --> 00:01:38,553
"I told you, you don't have to."

27
00:01:39,946 --> 00:01:40,694
"Please... just let me help."

28
00:01:42,696 --> 00:01:44,195
"Please... I'll feel so guilty if I don't."

29
00:01:44,195 --> 00:01:46,819
"I don't want to feel guilty forever."

30
00:01:46,819 --> 00:01:48,085
[ CASHIER ]

31
00:01:48,085 --> 00:01:52,068
"Please... I already feel bad enough as it is."

32
00:01:52,068 --> 00:01:54,806
"I'm the reason you got hurt. Just let me help."

33
00:01:54,806 --> 00:01:56,802
"Come on!

34
00:01:56,802 --> 00:01:58,891
Go sit down."

35
00:01:58,891 --> 00:02:01,215
"Yaa... I told you, you don't have to."

36
00:02:01,215 --> 00:02:06,112
"Din... please. Otherwise, I'll definitely feel guilty forever."

37
00:02:08,401 --> 00:02:09,296
"Company insurance covers it..

38
00:02:09,296 --> 00:02:10,951
You don't have to pay today."

39
00:02:12,233 --> 00:02:14,326
"Oh... right, insurance."

40
00:02:14,326 --> 00:02:15,433
"I didn't even think of that."

41
00:02:15,433 --> 00:02:17,378
"Our company's pretty awesome, huh?"

42
00:02:17,378 --> 00:02:21,206
"Mmm... but I still feel guilty anyway, Sorry."

43
00:02:22,982 --> 00:02:26,240
"Stop it... It was an accident. You don't need to overthink it."

44
00:02:28,773 --> 00:02:30,669
"Um... if you really feel that bad about it..."

45
00:02:30,669 --> 00:02:32,734
"How about you treat me to a meal then?"

46
00:02:32,734 --> 00:02:33,893
"I'm actually hungry...

47
00:02:33,893 --> 00:02:36,014
But first, let me go grab my meds."

48
00:04:45,380 --> 00:04:46,021
"My dad's calling."

49
00:04:49,421 --> 00:04:50,299
"Aren't you gonna answer it?"

50
00:04:50,299 --> 00:04:52,162
"Won't he get mad?"

51
00:04:53,171 --> 00:04:54,590
"Yeah, he probably will."

52
00:04:54,590 --> 00:04:58,584
"But... I'm really not ready to talk right now."

53
00:05:00,545 --> 00:05:01,602
"Why?

54
00:05:01,602 --> 00:05:02,841
Are you guys having issues?"

55
00:05:04,878 --> 00:05:08,504
"Come on... He's your dad. He'll listen to you no matter what."

56
00:05:08,504 --> 00:05:10,262
"I'm sure you guys can talk it out."

57
00:05:15,168 --> 00:05:17,205
"Hey... or are you stressed about the competition?"

58
00:05:20,459 --> 00:05:21,675
"Don't stress too much..

59
00:05:21,675 --> 00:05:23,368
We still have another round left."

60
00:05:23,368 --> 00:05:27,838
"Either way, I'm sure we'll win the next round."

61
00:05:45,123 --> 00:05:45,685
"Hello? ...

62
00:05:46,872 --> 00:05:47,742
Yes, P'Ya."

63
00:05:50,330 --> 00:05:51,455
"What?!"

64
00:05:52,872 --> 00:05:53,838
"How is P'Din doing?"

65
00:05:55,871 --> 00:05:57,910
"How is P'Din doing?"

66
00:06:01,287 --> 00:06:04,161
"Phew... Okay, got it."

67
00:06:04,161 --> 00:06:06,700
"I'll go check on P'Din myself."

68
00:06:08,661 --> 00:06:10,094
"Alright... Thank you so much, P'Yaa."
